        "about": "Simulation Engineer | AI Enthusiast | Digital Engineering\n\nPassionate about leveraging simulation and artificial intelligence to solve complex engineering challenges.\nMy work focuses on applying physics-based modeling, numerical methods, and AI-driven approaches to improve product development, optimize performance, and enable informed engineering decisions. I am particularly interested in bridging traditional simulation techniques with emerging AI technologies to create smarter, faster, and more scalable engineering workflows.\nWith experience across computational engineering, digital engineering and optimization I enjoy transforming complex physical phenomena into actionable insights. I believe simulation and AI are key enablers of next-generation engineering, helping organizations reduce development time, improve product performance, and accelerate innovation.\n\nMy goal is simple: make engineering faster, smarter, and more predictive through Simulation and AI.",
