                "date_given": "June 26, 2026",
                "text": "I had the pleasure of working with Mayur at Altair, now Siemens and it was always a great experience. He is genuinely passionate about using AI to solve engineering challenges and has a strong understanding of simulation-driven workflows. What sets him apart is not just his technical expertise, but also his willingness to help others and his collaborative mindset. I truly enjoyed working with Mayur and would happily recommend him to any team looking to advance AI in engineering."
